# Class with functional-dependency metadata: [class [Name a b c] [determines:... resolver:...] method: Sig]
# Verifies the two-bracket class body syntax with determines and resolver fields.
# (class_with_fd.llt-eval tests a 3-param MPTC; this tests the single-param class body form.)
[
  # Single-param class with no FDs: minimal two-bracket form with empty structural metadata
  Printable: [class [let Printable a] []
    to-str: [Fn@String [a]]]

  # Two-param class with FD: (src) determines dst (a coercion class)
  Coercible: [class [let Coercible src dst] [determines: [[[src] dst]]  resolver: CoercibleResolver]
    coerce: [Fn@dst [src]]]

  result: 42
]

---

%.result
=== out
Int(42)
